      743.08,
      563.55,
      841.78
    ],
    "text": "The sea areas off the coasts extending from Kankasanthurai to Chilaw via Mannar and from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota will be rough at times. The wave height may increase about (2.5 \u2013 3.0) meters in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Pottuvil via Galle and Matara. Near shore sea areas off the coast extending from Beruwala to Matara via Galle, may experience surges due to swell waves.",
